=== meta ===
bypass: 112
rule: CI_WORKFLOW_TOUCHED
title: a leading `.` hides the test job, the way GitLab documents disabling one
origin: issue #214, D-113 reading — a hidden job never runs; one no job `extends:` is a job set
origin2: aside, so its runner commands are dead sites.
=== before: .gitlab-ci.yml ===
stages:
  - lint
  - test

lint:
  stage: lint
  image: python:3.12
  script:
    - pip install ruff
    - ruff check .

test:
  stage: test
  image: python:3.12
  script:
    - pip install -e .[test]
    - pytest
=== after: .gitlab-ci.yml ===
stages:
  - lint
  - test

lint:
  stage: lint
  image: python:3.12
  script:
    - pip install ruff
    - ruff check .

.test:
  stage: test
  image: python:3.12
  script:
    - pip install -e .[test]
    - pytest
